---
import { NAV, SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<footer class="bg-ink text-mist">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-page gap-10 px-5 py-14 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr] md:px-8">
    <div>
      <p class="font-display text-3xl text-cream">waxphx<span class="text-gold">.com</span></p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Domain name for sale. Not a salon. Asking {SITE.askingPriceLabel}. Serious inquiries to{' '}
        <a class="text-cream underline decoration-white/30 underline-offset-4" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">On this site</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        {
          NAV.map((item) => (
            <li>
              <a class="hover:text-cream" href={item.href}>
                {item.label}
              </a>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">Acquisition</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li>Asking price {SITE.askingPriceLabel} USD</li>
        <li>Escrow or registrar push</li>
        <li>Reply within one business day</li>
        <li>{SITE.location}</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-page space-y-4 px-5 py-8 text-xs leading-relaxed md:px-8">
      <p>
        waxphx.com is offered for sale as a domain registration only. This site is not a waxing business, booking
        service, or franchise offering, and it does not guarantee search rankings, type-in traffic, or resale value.
        Buying the domain does not transfer a trademark, customers, or an operating company. Population figures are
        the U.S. Census Bureau July 1, 2025 estimate for the Phoenix-Mesa-Chandler metro, as published by FRED series
        PHXPOP and retrieved September 27, 2026. The asking price is not an appraisal.
      </p>
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} waxphx.com. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
